As a Tomcat derivative, tc Server can be configured with an “AccessLogValve”. A Valve element represents a component that can be inserted into the request processing pipeline.  The pattern attribute of the “AccessLogValve” controls which data gets logged. The “%t” parameter specifies that the system time should be recorded.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
